    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Throughout the ages, time and time again, there is one singular truth that shines through all darkness. Nothing is stronger than the indomitable human spirit. You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li>Increase your Wisdom or Constitution score by 1, up to a maximum of 20.</li><li>Your d4s from your Strong Will feature increase to d6s.</li><li>When you score a critical hit on a creature, you regain a use of your Strong will.</li><li>You gain a bonus to Death Saving Throws equal to your proficiency bonus.</li></ul>",
